WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.080
Okay, great. Are you a liberal?

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.080
Sex sells, but so does racism.

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:07.640
And I discovered that for those who know how to use AI, it's a damn good business model.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.540
There are 54 Muslim countries, yet they come to my home and say bacon and dogs are offensive.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.300
Sorry, but they can f**k themselves.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:17.500
This video has over 3 million views.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.360
One person comments that she is only saying what we are all thinking.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.040
But she isn't thinking, because she doesn't exist.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:33.240
I found loads of Instagram accounts featuring different AI-generated women following the same script for the same racist, sexist and homophobic jokes.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:36.520
And they have... something else in common.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.200
They're all young, attractive women.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.720
Most of the accounts seemingly appeared within months of each other.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:51.400
And while many put out an all-American image, see Texas girl Alex Starr, her account was made in the Czech Republic,

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.520
Other locations include the Philippines and Sweden.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.400
So what's going on?

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:02.440
Well, follow the link in many of their bios and you'll usually end up on Fanview.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:05.480
Like only fans, but with a business model that allows

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:09.880
AI-generated influencers to make not suitable for work content.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:14.840
And I managed to speak to a human creator behind one of these voluptuous, offensive women.

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:20.280
The man I spoke to is from a North African country.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:27.080
He told me that despite being Muslim himself, anti-immigrant content gets views, and it's helped

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:34.440
him earn thousands from his mostly American and British subscriber base, who he says on the whole

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:41.240
believe they're talking to real women. While Fanview does label its AI content, out of the 16

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:48.520
Instagram accounts I found, only four of them were labeled as AI generated, with a fifth labeling only

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:57.000
some posts. One British presenting account, aptly named Lottie from UK, does label its posts as AI

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:03.720
generated. Go to the link in her bio and you'll see her fan view and a donation link to the far

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:09.320
right political party Restore Britain. But this isn't the first time people with seemingly no

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:15.000
skin in the game have profited from inflammatory political content. Last year an investigation

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.800
uncovered a network of more than 100 Facebook pages run from Sri Lanka.

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:24.520
So behind these AI generated, big-breasted, politically incorrect women

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:29.800
are real people making real money. While the division they're fueling is very real too,

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:35.320
these creators don't need to believe in what they're selling. They just need enough people to buy it.
